Mellow Attribution Notice
=========================

MellowGPU remake development, 2026-10-16
--------------------------------------
The active product is renamed MellowGPU. The original Mellow history, source,
licenses and hardware-evidence limits are preserved. New development adds
vendor-neutral native lifetime contracts, complete Metal 3/system support-profile
policy and immutable upstream-update verification. NullMoth and Cobalt64 are
architectural references; their code is not copied or relicensed by this change.
Build and synthetic contract tests do not establish full Metal 3, WindowServer,
application/game or physical display acceleration. Existing root and per-file
licenses continue to control their respective material.

