Local 7D41 development snapshot, 2026-09-05
-----------------------------------------
This snapshot modifies NiSeullent/Mellow commit
f895d89653ea5cad3a534cce46a62d0f59384d71. Local changes include checked hardware
access, startup and pattern admission, honest command completion, guarded
patches, host tests, and reproducible cross-build tools. Version 0.1.1 is a local
development label, not an official upstream release or a hardware support claim.
Original licenses and per-file notices are preserved. HDE64 test decoder source
and its license/provenance are retained in tests/accel_hde.

Local integration version 0.2.0, 2026-09-05: adds Xe VM/PTE/PDE, IOKit DMA pin adapter, private CPU page-table builder, CSS parser, queue/fence lifecycle, VM-to-queue bridge, actual Intel offline compiler evidence, and ABI/probe tooling. These changes do not implement a complete hardware submission or Metal userspace driver.

Local integration version 0.3.0, 2026-09-05: adds actual BAR0/forcewake adapters,
pinned page-table backing, GuC MMIO/CTB/HXG transport, Intel Zebin staging and
