analysis inputs and are not included in this driver development package.

Intel/NVIDIA and Apple userspace development checkpoint, 2026-09-30
----------------------------------------------------------------
This checkpoint changes Intel GuC terminal/ring ownership, adds a pinned NVIDIA
packet encoder, and adds original bounded Apple Metal-selector compute/render
adapters, IOSurface GPU rendering, application-layer presentation and read-only
Metal runtime metadata collection. It also integrates source-family intake
contracts from a parallel local worktree. Original licenses and notices remain
controlling. New per-file MIT notices apply only to those original files.
No complete unsupported-GPU driver, system Metal registration, WindowServer
acceleration or native hardware acceptance is implied by this source checkpoint.

Native GPU owner and firmware-format development, 2026-09-30
----------------------------------------------------------
Selected local peer source adds real IOKit pin/MMIO adapters and bounded native
