Initial v1 specification and portable AMD packet unit, 2026-10-16
----------------------------------------------------------------
Adds original metadata-only three-vendor interfaces, versioned contracts, source
consistency tooling and a public Objective-C runtime metadata helper. The GFX9
PM4 packet encoder retains AMD notices, the MIT license and exact per-file
provenance under Drivers/NativeAmd. No firmware image is redistributed, and
